What this repository contains
  * Patch scripts (patch_*.py), a few small C++ include files and a JavaScript/PHP page extension. They add code to FPP 5.x files at install
    time. This repository does NOT contain copies of FPP's own source files: the patchers match anchors in the installed FPP and insert our
    additions, so FPP's files stay under FPP's licence (GPL v2 for the 5.x files this targets).
  * FPP 10.x and newer distribute their BeagleBone pixel driver under CC BY-ND 4.0 (no derivative works may be distributed). This project
    therefore supports FPP 5.x only and ships no modified copy or patch of those files.
  * SPIPixels/ - an FPP channel-output plugin for clocked pixel chips (GPL v2).
  * hwtest/ - measurement tools used to verify the work; research/ - datasheet research notes with their sources.

Third-party references (not included, used only to cross-check timing and frames)
  FastLED (MIT), NeoPixelBus (LGPL v3), Adafruit NeoPixel (LGPL v3), WLED (EUPL), chip manufacturers' public datasheets.
  Chip and product names belong to their owners and are used only to say what the software works with.

Falcon Player: https://github.com/FalconChristmas/fpp (GPL v2). This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the FPP developers.
